      "source_quote": "初，山賓在州，所部平陸縣不稔，啓出倉米以贍人。",
      "reading": "在北兗州遇平陸歉收，啓出倉米賑濟。",
      "note": "在北兗州遇平陸歉收，啓出倉米賑濟。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 23,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:received_sentence3-23",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA",
      "source_quote": "後刺史檢州曹，失簿書，以山賓爲耗闕，有司追責，籍其宅入官，山賓默不自理，更市地造宅。",
      "reading": "後任檢州曹失簿，追責籍宅，山賓不自理，另買地築宅。",
      "note": "後任檢州曹失簿，追責籍宅，山賓不自理，另買地築宅。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 23,
      "end_codepoint": 65,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:received_sentence3-65",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA",
      "source_quote": "昭明太子聞築室不就，有令曰：「明祭酒雖出撫大籓，擁旄推轂，珥金拖紫，而恒事屢空。",
      "reading": "昭明太子聞之，令稱明祭酒出鎮、居官而貧。此處不就是築室未就。",
      "note": "昭明太子聞之，令稱明祭酒出鎮、居官而貧。此處不就是築室未就。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 65,
      "end_codepoint": 105,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:received_sentence3-105",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA",
      "source_quote": "聞構宇未成，今送薄助。」",
      "reading": "太子送助，未載所助數額。",
      "note": "太子送助，未載所助數額。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 105,
      "end_codepoint": 117,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:received_sentence3-117",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA",
      "source_quote": "並貽詩曰：「平仲古稱奇，夷吾昔檀美。",
      "reading": "太子贈詩以平仲、夷吾起興。殿本及南史作擅美，數位梁書作檀美。",
      "note": "太子贈詩以平仲、夷吾起興。殿本及南史作擅美，數位梁書作檀美。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 117,
      "end_codepoint": 135,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:received_sentence3-135",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA",
      "source_quote": "令則挺伊賢，東秦固多士。",
      "reading": "詩以東秦之多士美其人。",
      "note": "詩以東秦之多士美其人。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 135,
      "end_codepoint": 147,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:received_sentence3-147",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA",
      "source_quote": "築室非道傍，置宅歸仁里。",
      "reading": "置宅歸仁里承前敘築室。",
      "note": "置宅歸仁里承前敘築室。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 147,
      "end_codepoint": 159,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:received_sentence3-159",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA",
      "source_quote": "庚桑方有係，原生今易擬。",
      "reading": "庚桑、原生為贈詩用典，與莊子畏壘之山、原憲環堵之室參讀。",
      "note": "庚桑、原生為贈詩用典，與莊子畏壘之山、原憲環堵之室參讀。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 159,
      "end_codepoint": 171,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:received_sentence3-171",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA",
      "source_quote": "必來三徑人，將招《五經》士。」",
      "reading": "三徑人、五經士均以類稱，未具來客姓名。",
      "note": "三徑人、五經士均以類稱，未具來客姓名。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 171,
      "end_codepoint": 186,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:received_sentence4-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA",
      "source_quote": "山賓性篤實，家中嘗乏用，貨所乘牛。",
      "reading": "家乏用，賣所乘牛。",
      "note": "家乏用，賣所乘牛。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 17,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:received_sentence4-17",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA",
      "source_quote": "旣售受錢，乃謂買主曰：「此牛經患漏蹄，治差已久，恐後脫髮，無容不相語。」",
      "reading": "收錢後告買主，牛舊患漏蹄，雖治差，恐後復發。殿本「脱發」，數位「脫髮」。",
      "note": "收錢後告買主，牛舊患漏蹄，雖治差，恐後復發。殿本「脱發」，數位「脫髮」。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 17,
      "end_codepoint": 53,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:received_sentence4-53",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA",
      "source_quote": "買主遽追取錢。",
      "reading": "買主追回錢。",
      "note": "買主追回錢。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 53,
      "end_codepoint": 60,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:received_sentence4-60",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA",
      "source_quote": "處士阮孝緒聞之，歎曰：「此言足使還淳反朴，激薄停澆矣。」",
      "reading": "處士阮孝緒讚山賓能使人還淳反朴，為聞者而非買牛者。",
      "note": "處士阮孝緒讚山賓能使人還淳反朴，為聞者而非買牛者。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 60,
      "end_codepoint": 88,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:received_sentence5-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA",
      "source_quote": "五年，又爲國子博士，常侍、中正如故。",
      "reading": "普通五年再為國子博士，常侍、中正如故。",
      "note": "普通五年再為國子博士，常侍、中正如故。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 18,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:received_sentence5-18",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA",
      "source_quote": "其年以本官假節，權攝北兗州事。",
      "reading": "同年假節，權攝北兗州事；前在天監十五年曾實任北兗刺史。",
      "note": "同年假節，權攝北兗州事；前在天監十五年曾實任北兗刺史。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 18,
      "end_codepoint": 33,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:received_sentence5-33",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA",
      "source_quote": "大通元年，卒，時年八十五。",
      "reading": "大通元年卒，源報八十五歲。南史僅作後卒官。",
      "note": "大通元年卒，源報八十五歲。南史僅作後卒官。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 33,
      "end_codepoint": 46,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:received_sentence5-46",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA",
      "source_quote": "詔贈侍中、信威將軍。",
      "reading": "卒後詔贈侍中、信威將軍。南史僅列贈侍中。",
      "note": "卒後詔贈侍中、信威將軍。南史僅列贈侍中。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:p005",
