      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA",
      "source_quote": "授經以來，迄今二紀。",
      "reading": "太子稱授經迄今二紀，保留原數，未繫確切授經日。",
      "note": "太子稱授經迄今二紀，保留原數，未繫確切授經日。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 143,
      "end_codepoint": 153,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:received_sentence5-153",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA",
      "source_quote": "若其上交不諂，造膝忠規，非顯外迹，得之胸懷者，蓋亦積矣。",
      "reading": "回憶山賓上交不諂，面進忠規。",
      "note": "回憶山賓上交不諂，面進忠規。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:p005",
