      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA",
      "source_quote": "攝官連率，行當言歸，不謂長往，眇成疇日。",
      "reading": "原期攝官後還，卻長往。",
      "note": "原期攝官後還，卻長往。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:p005",
