      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA",
      "source_quote": "追憶談緒，皆爲悲端，往矣如何！",
      "reading": "追憶談緒而悲。",
      "note": "追憶談緒而悲。",
