      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA",
      "source_quote": "昔經聯事，理當酸愴也。」",
      "reading": "以曾聯事勸殷芸同悼，令文至此。",
      "note": "以曾聯事勸殷芸同悼，令文至此。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-027-mingshanbin-complete:p005",
